  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Stick Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Sulfates SLS &amp; SLES</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Parabens</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A precision sculpting stick designed to shape, define, and enhance your favorite features for natural-looking dimension.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skin Type:</strong> Normal and Combination</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage:</strong> Medium</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation:</strong> Cream</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> Patrick's artistry sticks are designed for the details, whether enhancing your eyes or the curve of your Cupid’s bow. Create clean, controlled lines across the face for extra cut and instant dimension. The soft-matte formula glides smoothly over skin, while the built-in brush supports easy blending.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Definition: Use the defining shades to add extra depth and definition to the eyes, nose, cheekbones, and lips. <br>-Apply directly to skin and blend with the built-in brush. <br>-Brightness: Use the brightening shades to enhance the eyes, nose, and browbone. <br>-Apply directly to skin and blend with the built-in brush.<br>-Artistry tip: Use any shade from the collection as an eyeshadow.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Isononyl Isononanoate, Octyldodecanol, Synthetic Wax, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Silica, Mica, Cera Microcristallina (Microcrystalline Wax), Disteardimonium Hectorite, Dimethicone, Phenoxyethanol, May Contain (+/-): Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491), Iron Oxides (CI 77492), Iron Oxides (CI 77499).</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Stick Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Sulfates SLS &amp; SLES</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Parabens</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A precision sculpting stick designed to shape, define, and enhance your favorite features for natural-looking dimension.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skin Type:</strong> Normal and Combination</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage:</strong> Medium</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation:</strong> Cream</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> Patrick's artistry sticks are designed for the details, whether enhancing your eyes or the curve of your Cupid’s bow. Create clean, controlled lines across the face for extra cut and instant dimension. The soft-matte formula glides smoothly over skin, while the built-in brush supports easy blending.</p></div>\n<details clas